    "insert": "\n\nThe exposé addresses overcrowded healthcare systems by using LLM-based chatbots to prioritize patient urgency in appointment scheduling. The goal is to reduce waiting times, improve patient satisfaction, and ease staff workload. The approach involves adapting a diagnostic chatbot with a K-Nearest Neighbour (KNN) model for urgency classification and testing its impact through surveys, interviews, and performance analysis at a GP practice.\n\n"
